{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Ahp9eHB3StVzDheeXQLPP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 schema-dag-extraction 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (10 个)\\n\\n- **exp_fewrel_formal_80rel**: QUEUED — \\n- **exp_fewrel_formal**: RUNNING — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd_r2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **fewrel_pilot**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp004_maven_bcs**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp002_confusability_controlled**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-004**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp001_count_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_fewrel_formal | — | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_fewrel_formal_80rel（排队等待 GPU）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd_r2** (negative): —\\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd** (failed): —\\n  [exp008_run_script](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd/intermediate/run_exp008.sh)\\n- **fewrel_pilot** (success): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 5 / 负向 2 / 失败 1 / 共 8\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-38874: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RUPe8szH6qgkxttSJSecn8","session_id":"08912b4a-ab76-4663-b333-b897e4b7593f","uuid":"ca957ef6-4309-43cb-a2a8-c01c20075190","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:27:21.673Z"}
