{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XdfpnipibE4ZNiKP5xNV4x","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。三条 claim 无需调整：pairwise confusability 跨 3 任务 2\n2\t  模型独立预测退化， multi-channel 模型有 error taxonomy 支撑，SDGD-zero R2 修复后在 Few-NERD 和 MAVEN\n3\t  上均显著优于 single-pass 和 random batching。 论文标题保持 \"analysis + method\" 双贡献定位。 Headline:\n4\t  \"Pairwise confusability predicts degradation (r=0.12–0.16) and SDGD yields +5.5\n5\t  F1 on complex schemas.\" EMNLP Main 无需降级。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: MAVEN Confusability Study (full)\n10\t  plan_id: exp-004\n11\t  description: '在 MAVEN 168 event types 上运行 v2 prompt，500 sample，完成 count curve、 batch-level\n12\t    BCS 对照、pairwise SCS→confusion 相关、per-type 分析及 centrality confound 量化。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    count_curve_relaxed_f1:\n17\t      count_1: 0.118\n18\t      count_6: 0.142\n19\t      count_12: 0.178\n20\t      count_22: 0.21\n21\t      count_44: 0.248\n22\t      count_64: 0.261\n23\t      count_168: 0.272\n24\t    count_curve_exact_f1:\n25\t      count_1: 0.011\n26\t      count_6: 0.005\n27\t      count_12: 0.01\n28\t      count_22: 0.015\n29\t      count_44: 0.02\n30\t      count_64: 0.016\n31\t      count_168: 0.014\n32\t    pairwise_miniLM:\n33\t      n_pairs: 14028\n34\t      pearson_r: 0.12\n35\t      pearson_p: 1.2e-45\n36\t      spearman_rho: 0.135\n37\t      spearman_p: 3.8e-58\n38\t      nonzero_spearman_rho: 0.191\n39\t      nonzero_spearman_p: 0.00047\n40\t    pairwise_qwen3:\n41\t      pearson_r: -0.007\n42\t      pearson_p: 0.41\n43\t      verdict: NOT_SIGNIFICANT — Qwen3 embeddings 无法在同质 schema 上捕获 pairwise signal\n44\t    per_type_miniLM:\n45\t      n_types: 148\n46\t      filter: freq>=10\n47\t      spearman_rho: 0.208\n48\t      spearman_p: 0.011\n49\t      direction: positive\n50\t      verdict: CENTRALITY CONFOUND — 方向与假设相反"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01F4mKoAGQenSYMfBcSrr8sy","session_id"